<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86287" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ambassador,</i> acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβεια</span> (i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηα</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εα</span>) Hoffmann <i>Griech.
				Dialekte</i> ii No. <i><span class="en">
				160.31
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Lampasacus</span>); dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβεῦσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1056
				</span></i>
			, v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in EN</u>
				200.14
			</span></i>; nom. dual 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					639
				</span></i>
			: Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> denies that 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					93
				</span></i>
			 is gen. of this word: 
				Boeot.
			 pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρισγεῖες</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.2418.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i> (Thebes, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				1720.6
			</span></i> (Thespiae, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>) (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβῆες</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				245
			</span></i> belongs in form to this word, in meaning to 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			).</div>
